@@ -1,3 +1,14 @@
+# v0.6.3 - Vercel startup fix
+
+- Replaced legacy `vite-plugin-cesium` production externalization with Cesium's documented ESM/Vite pattern.
+- Explicitly copies Cesium Workers, ThirdParty, Assets and Widgets into `/gev/cesium/`.
+- Defines `CESIUM_BASE_URL` as `/gev/cesium/` at build time.
+- Imports Cesium widget CSS from the ESM package.
+- Added post-build asset validation so Vercel cannot deploy a client whose HTML references missing `/gev/*` files.
+- Added a 45-second boot watchdog and visible startup error reporting instead of an infinite splash.
+- Added boot stage telemetry and bounded shared-state restoration.
+- Isolated optional voice/commercial initialization so those capabilities cannot block the original globe.
+
 # Changelog
 
 This changelog records public product changes. For the authoritative description
